@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Liveness: 200 OK, text body Healthy
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Generated OpenAPI (Development only): 200 OK, JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Swagger UI (Development only): redirect or 200 OK, HTML
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger

### Unknown route: 404, application/problem+json, traceId
GET {{baseUrl}}/does-not-exist

### Test-only controller is absent from the running application: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/__test/failure
